# Service backend user: full access to device topics
user scud_backend
topic readwrite stat
topic readwrite rep
topic readwrite com/#
topic readwrite photos
# Прошивки ПИВ v2 публикуют в <kind>/{id}; бэкенд подписан на обе схемы.
topic readwrite stat/#
topic readwrite rep/#
topic readwrite photos/#
topic read $SYS/#

# Per-device template: a relay-{id} device may write shared stat/rep/photos
# and read ONLY its own command topic com/{id} (id = %u suffix after "relay-").
# Pattern %u = username. Device username is "relay-<id>"; firmware reads com/<id>.
# Phase 1 keeps device write on shared topics; per-id com read is enforced per-user
# at provisioning time (Plan 2 generates explicit per-user blocks). The pattern below
# is the shared baseline applied to every authenticated non-backend user.
pattern write stat
pattern write rep
pattern write photos
# Per-id права (stat/{id} и т.д.) шаблоном не выразить: %u — это имя
# пользователя relay-{id}, а не голый {id}. Их выписывает провижининг
# поимённо, так же как topic read com/{id}.
